Documentation     [SUITE PURPOSE]
...                  == CB09915-C-IWK18-IWK19 Test suite ==
...                  - Requested topology : CLOUD_5G_I_LO_AP_LO and VARIANT_SANSA_FS_CPRI_CMWV_FDD+ECPRI_CMWV_TDD_AEQE
...                  - The aim is to check IWK between FDD PRB Blanking and CB010596 configured on all TDD cells (IWK18).
...                  - The aim is to check IWK between FDD PRB Blanking and CB010544 configured on all TDD cells (IWK19).
...                  - actLongPucchResourceOpt configuration is the same on all TDD cells.
...                  - The test verify behavior of Long PUCCH resource optimization for FR1 TDD cells.
...                  == Prerequisite ==
...                  - gNB configured with 4 Cells & RU detected. Physical cells id are 50, 51, etc.
...                  - CB008941 (UL Fragmentaion) is activated
...                  - cellBwpList used for BHE=55 + BLE=0 without PS BWP
...                    - cellBwpId: '0'
...                      bwpDN: 'MRBTS-1/NRBTS-1/BWP_PROFILE-5'     initial BWP - 100MHZ, BWP#0
...                    - cellBwpId: '1'
...                      bwpDN: 'MRBTS-1/NRBTS-1/BWP_PROFILE-57'    default dedicated BWP - 100MHZ, BWP#1
...                  - cellBwpList used for BHE=20 + BLE=25 without PS BWP
...                    - cellBwpId: '0'
...                      bwpDN: 'MRBTS-1/NRBTS-1/BWP_PROFILE-6'     initial BWP - 100MHZ, BWP#0
...                    - cellBwpId: '1'
...                      bwpDN: 'MRBTS-1/NRBTS-1/BWP_PROFILE-67'    default dedicated BWP - 100MHZ, BWP#1
...                  - cellBwpList used for PS BWP + BHE=0 + BLE=55
...                    - cellBwpId: '0'
...                      bwpDN: 'MRBTS-1/NRBTS-1/BWP_PROFILE-7'     initial BWP - 60MHZ, BWP#0
...                    - cellBwpId: '1'
...                      bwpDN: 'MRBTS-1/NRBTS-1/BWP_PROFILE-77'    default dedicated BWP - 100MHZ, BWP#1
...                    - cellBwpId: '2'
...                      bwpDN: 'MRBTS-1/NRBTS-1/BWP_PROFILE-70'    Power Saving BWP - 40MHZ, BWP#2
...                  - cellBwpList used for PS BWP + BHE=55 + BLE=0
...                    - cellBwpId: '0'
...                      bwpDN: 'MRBTS-1/NRBTS-1/BWP_PROFILE-8'     initial BWP - 60MHZ, BWP#0
...                    - cellBwpId: '1'
...                      bwpDN: 'MRBTS-1/NRBTS-1/BWP_PROFILE-87'    default dedicated BWP - 100MHZ, BWP#1
...                    - cellBwpId: '2'
...                      bwpDN: 'MRBTS-1/NRBTS-1/BWP_PROFILE-80'    Power Saving BWP - 40MHZ, BWP#2
...                  - cellBwpList used for PS BWP + BHE=20 + BLE=25
...                    - cellBwpId: '0'
...                      bwpDN: 'MRBTS-1/NRBTS-1/BWP_PROFILE-9'     initial BWP - 60MHZ, BWP#0
...                    - cellBwpId: '1'
...                      bwpDN: 'MRBTS-1/NRBTS-1/BWP_PROFILE-97'    default dedicated BWP - 100MHZ, BWP#1
...                    - cellBwpId: '2'
...                      bwpDN: 'MRBTS-1/NRBTS-1/BWP_PROFILE-90'    Power Saving BWP - 40MHZ, BWP#2
...                  - cellBwpList used for Multi-Dedicated-BWP + PS BWP + BHE=0 + BLE=55
...                    - cellBwpId: '0'
...                      bwpDN: 'MRBTS-1/NRBTS-1/BWP_PROFILE-2'     initial BWP - 60MHZ, BWP#0
...                    - cellBwpId: '1'
...                      bwpDN: 'MRBTS-1/NRBTS-1/BWP_PROFILE-27'    default dedicated BWP - 100MHZ, BWP#1
...                    - cellBwpId: '2'
...                      bwpDN: 'MRBTS-1/NRBTS-1/BWP_PROFILE-23'    Small BWP - 60MHZ, BWP#2
...                    - cellBwpId: '3'
...                      bwpDN: 'MRBTS-1/NRBTS-1/BWP_PROFILE-20'    Power Saving BWP - 40MHZ, BWP#3
...                  - cellBwpList used for PS BWP + BHE=0 + BLE=55 (Static PDCCH Configuration)
...                    - cellBwpId: '0'
...                      bwpDN: 'MRBTS-1/NRBTS-1/BWP_PROFILE-3'     initial BWP - 60MHZ, BWP#0
...                    - cellBwpId: '1'
...                      bwpDN: 'MRBTS-1/NRBTS-1/BWP_PROFILE-37'    default dedicated BWP - 100MHZ, BWP#1
...                    - cellBwpId: '2'
...                      bwpDN: 'MRBTS-1/NRBTS-1/BWP_PROFILE-30'    Power Saving BWP - 40MHZ, BWP#2
...                  == Scope ==
...                  - call setup - nGBR traffic several Ues
