    ...  - Based on TtiTraces, Check PDSCH region with DL PRB Blanking contraints
    ...  - Calls for multi ues are passed / no DL and UL Dtx / no Dl and UL Bler
    [Tags]  CRT
    Set To Dictionary       ${C_Cell}    totalNbOfUe       4
    TC CB009915 C scenario  ${C_Cell}  ${dictParam}  ${Vendor_IWK_CB8940-L_CB7113}  ${dict_settings_all_ues}    ${dict_settings_all_cells}  nrCell=4
    ...          kw NIDD Set=Set CB009915-C NIDD PARAMETERS
    ...          kw NIDD Check=Check CB009915-C NIDD PARAMETERS
    ...          kw Specific Set TestMode After Attach=Override and Activate UE CSI profile for all ${C_Cell.totalNbOfUe} Ues
    ...          NIDD_9915_PARAMS=${NIDD_9915_PARAMS_TESTS}
    ...          kw Specific Check=Check CB009915 Based L1L2 PCAP
    ...          kw Specific Check CPRT=Check CB009915 Based CPRT PCAP
    ...          kw Check SCF parameters=verify_SCF_Paramaters
    ...          Kw TestLine Preparation=TL_Preparation_CB009915_IWK18_4Cells_w_CB010596_Long_PUCCH_resource_optimization
    ...          Json test configuration=${relative_json_path}


PRV_CB009915-C_IWK19_with_UE_Power_Saving_Full_Flexible_Setting_Of_Initial_BWP_Respect_To_PS_BWP
    [Documentation]
    ...  == DESCRIPTION ==
    ...  - Test case purpose is to verify behavior IWK between FDD PRB Blanking and CB010596 configured on all TDD cells..
    ...  - The test verify behavior of Long PUCCH resource optimization for FR1 TDD cells.
    ...
    ...  == PRECONDITION ==
    ...  - gNB2 classical - real hardware - ABIO with simulated 2x AEQE
    ...  - AMF1 simulated
    ...  - Airphone simulator configured for SA mode
    ...  - NR cells are up and connected to AMF1
    ...  - gNB2 up and running with 2 SANSA TDD cells (band n78)
    ...  - GNB is configured with profile
    ...              2x100MHz 4DL-4UL streams NR TDD FR1 BF cell"
    ...  - CB008941 (UL Fragmentaion) is activated
    ...  - NRCELL-1.chBw = 100Mz
    ...  - NRCELL-1.cellTechnology = TDD
    ...  - NRCELL-1.actLongPucchResourceOpt = true
    ...  - NRCELL-1.pucchF1ResOccConf  = 2-2-0_OCCs
    ...  - NRCELL-1.pucchNumberHarqAnPrbs = Set_by_system
    ...  - NRCELL-1.gscnOrSsPbchArfcn = 7880
    ...  - NRCELL-1.msg1FrequencyStart = 120
    ...  - NRCELL-1.actDynUlResAlloc = True (CB006878)
    ...   (NRCELL-1.msg1frequencyStart is outside range <cRbStartUl, cRbStartUl+cRbSizeUl> of the BWP_PROFILE-50 (RACH is outside the PS-BWP, >106))
    ...   (NRCELL-1.msg1frequencyStart is inside range <cRbStartUl, cRbStartUl+cRbSizeUl> of the BWP_PROFILE-5 (RACH is inside the initial BWP, <162))
    ...  - NRCELL-1.ueConnectionEstablishmentMode = useDedicatedBwp
    ...  - NRCELL-1.cellBwpList =
    ...    - cellBwpId: '0'
    ...      bwpDN: 'MRBTS-1/NRBTS-1/BWP_PROFILE-7'     initial BWP - 60MHZ, BWP#0
    ...    - cellBwpId: '1'
    ...      bwpDN: 'MRBTS-1/NRBTS-1/BWP_PROFILE-77'    default dedicated BWP - 100MHZ, BWP#1
    ...    - cellBwpId: '2'
    ...      bwpDN: 'MRBTS-1/NRBTS-1/BWP_PROFILE-70'    Power Saving BWP - 40MHZ, BWP#2
    ...
    ...
    ...  - NRBTS-1.actMultipleDedicatedBWPs = false
    ...  - NRBTS-1.dlRateThresholdFromPsBwp = 350
    ...  - NRBTS-1.dlRateThresholdToPsBwp = 300

    ...
    ...  - NRCELL-2.actLongPucchResourceOpt = true
    ...  - NRCELL-2.pucchF1ResOccConf  = 2-2-0_OCCs
    ...  - NRCELL-1.pucchNumberHarqAnPrbs = 4_PRBs
    ...  - NRCELL-2.gscnOrSsPbchArfcn = 7880
    ...  - NRCELL-2.msg1FrequencyStart = 120
    ...  - NRCELL-2.actDynUlResAlloc = True (CB006878)
    ...
    ...  - NRCELL-1.actPRBBlanking= true on the 2 cells with following configuration
    ...  - NRBTS.NRCELL-1.trsMutingInBlankedPRBsEnabled = true
    ...  - NRCELL-1.nbrOfBlankedPRBsLowEdgeDL = 55
    ...  - NRCELL-1.nbrOfBlankedPRBsLowEdgeUL = 55
    ...  - NRCELL-1.nbrOfBlankedPRBsHighEdgeDL = 0
    ...  - NRCELL-1.nbrOfBlankedPRBsHighEdgeUL = 0
    ...  - NRCELL-2.nbrOfBlankedPRBsLowEdgeDL = 25
    ...  - NRCELL-2.nbrOfBlankedPRBsLowEdgeUL = 25
    ...  - NRCELL-2.nbrOfBlankedPRBsHighEdgeDL = 20
    ...  - NRCELL-2.nbrOfBlankedPRBsHighEdgeUL = 20
    ...
    ...  - TDD Frame Structure is set to semi static
    ...     NRBTS/NRCELL/tddFrameStructure. frameStructureType = semiStatic
    ...     NRBTS/NRCELL/tddFrameStructure. guardPeriodLength = 2Symbols
    ...     NRBTS/NRCELL/tddFrameStructure. ulDlDataSlotRatio = 1/4
    ...
    ...    - Test with 4 Ues  (2Ues for Cell1 and 2ue for Cell2)
    ...
    ...  == TESTING TOOLS ==
    ...    AirPhone, EPCSIM, UTE
    ...
    ...  == TEST ENVIRONMENT ==
    ...  - gNB classicBTS in SANSA mode
    ...  - HARDWARE ID:  gNB(ASOE) with 2 simulated AEQE radio modules
    ...  - UE configured in SA, TDD,
    ...
    ...  == Checks / Verdict ==
    ...  - Verify that UL and DL Fragmentation are enabled
    ...  - Based on CPRT pcap, Check PUCCH regions (sr, harq and pcsi) with UL PrbBlanking contraints
    ...  - Based on L1L2 pcap, Check PUCCH regions (sr, harq and pcsi) with UL PrbBlanking contraints
    ...  - Based on L1L2 pcap, Check prachPrbOffset with UL PrbBlanking contraints
    ...  - Check PUCCH size
    ...  - Based on TtiTraces, Check PUSCH region with UL PRB Blanking contraints and PUCCH size
    ...  - Based on TtiTraces, Check PDSCH region with DL PRB Blanking contraints
    ...  - Calls for multi ues are passed / no DL and UL Dtx / no Dl and UL Bler
    [Tags]  NO_CRT
    Set To Dictionary       ${C_Cell}    totalNbOfUe       4
    TC CB009915 C PS BWP switch scenario  ${C_Cell}  ${dictParam}  ${Vendor_IWK_CB8940-L_CB7113}  ${dict_settings_all_ues}
    ...          ${dict_settings_all_cells}     nrCell=4
    ...          kw Set RAD Params=Set RAD Params Of 9915
    ...          kw NIDD Set=Set CB009915-C NIDD PARAMETERS
    ...          kw NIDD Check=Check CB009915-C NIDD PARAMETERS
    ...          NIDD_9915_PARAMS=${NIDD_9915_PARAMS_IWK19_TESTS_Cell1_wPS_BLE_55_Cell2_woPS_BLE_25_BHE_20}
    ...          kw Specific Check=Check CB009915 Based L1L2 PCAP
    ...          kw Specific Check CPRT=Check CB009915 Based CPRT PCAP
    ...          kw Check SCF parameters=verify_SCF_Paramaters_TC_w_PSBWP
    ...          Kw TestLine Preparation=TL_Preparation_CB009915_IWK19_4Cells_w_PSBWP
    ...          Json test configuration=${relative_json_path}

